 <h3><u>Ae mere baba</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4>Ae mere baba</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4> </font></u></b>
  <p><font face=Comic Sans MS size=4>(Aap gharibul watan me bhi gharibul watan) x2 Ae mere baba</font></p>
  <font face=Comic Sans MS size=4> 
   <ol>
    <li>Aap ka maydaan me tiro pe lashaa raha. (Mere gohar chin gaye aag se daman jalaa) x2 Ae mere baba. Aap rahe be kafan me bhi rahi be kafan</li>
    <p>(Aap gharibul watan me bhi gharibul watan) x2 Ae mere baba</p>
    <li>Aap ke halqoom par shimr ka khanjar chalaa (Mujko tamache lage sar se chini hai ridaa) x2 Ae mere baba. Aap ke neze pe sar mere gale me rasan</li>
