    <li>Aap ko roti rahi tashna labi dasht mei (Daag yatimi mila mujko isi dasht mei) x2 Ae mere baba. Aap hai tashna dahan mei bhi hu tashna dahan</li>
    <p>(Aap gharibul watan me bhi gharibul watan) x2 Ae mere baba</p>
    <li>Dono ki mazloomiyat dekhi hai aflaak ne (Dono ki hurmat rakhi dasht ke is khaak ne) x2 Ae mere baba. Khaak bani hai ridaa khaak bani hai kafan</li>
    <p>(Aap gharibul watan me bhi gharibul watan) x2 Ae mere baba</p>
    <li>Waqt musibat huwi dono hi hamse judaa (Dono ki taqdeer me tha game furkat likha) x2 Ae mere baba. Ek behen aap ki ek hai meri behen </li>
