    <li>Aap ke hamraah to Akbaro Abbas hai (Mujpe ye tanhaayiya roti hai zindaan mei) x2 Ae mere baba. Meri lahad qayd hai aap ka roza wo ban </li>
    <p>(Aap gharibul watan me bhi gharibul watan) x2 Ae mere baba</p>
    <li>Kalle alamdar se aap ki tuti kamar (Panjo pe chalte huwe mene kiya hai safar) x2 Ae mere baba. Aap ko sadmo ki aur mujko safar ki thakkan</li>
